# Redirects

The redirect table published by the Webflow site, as read from
`https://lux-radiology.webflow.io/manifest.json` (publish version 142, 2026-11-20),
and how each entry was ported into this site.

The ported site's source of truth is `migration-scripts/redirects.config.mjs`,
which generates `web/public/_redirects` (served by Cloudflare's asset layer before
the Worker runs). All 12 Webflow redirects are ported; 4 are re-pointed because
Webflow's own destination does not exist — two of them 404 on the live Webflow
site as well.

| From | Webflow sent to | Ported as | Note |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `/confirm` | `/c` | `/c` | verbatim |
| `/scan-planner` | `/scan` | `/scan` | verbatim |
| `/services/ultrasound-maternity` | `/services/pregnancy-scan` | `/services/pregnancy-scan` | verbatim |
| `/reviews/alexandria-ahchee` | `/reviews` | `/reviews` | verbatim |
| `/blog` | `/` | `/` | verbatim |
| `/loc/582-k-road` | `/contact` | `/contact` | verbatim |
| `/loc/195-ponsonby-rd` | `/contact` | `/contact` | verbatim |
| `/maternity` | `/scan-planner` | `/scan` | flattened — Webflow chained `/maternity` → `/scan-planner` → `/scan` one hop at a time |
| `/team/ginny-frame` | `/team/ginny` | `/about` | re-pointed — `/team/ginny` 404s even on Webflow, and no `/team` index exists; the team is presented on `/about` |
| `/poac-liver` | `/liver` | `/poac` | re-pointed — `/liver` does not exist anywhere; POAC referrer content lives behind the gated `/poac` |
| `/test/test-book-now` | `/test/book` | `/book` | re-pointed — the `/test/*` pages were deliberately not ported |
| `/test/modal` | `/test/modals` | `/book` | re-pointed — same; the modals under test were the booking popups |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> `redirects.config.mjs` is the single source of truth. Never edit
> `web/public/_redirects` by hand — regenerate it with
> `node migration-scripts/gen-redirects.mjs` (also runs as `prebuild`).
> The config also carries the site's own `/services/3d4d` → `/3d4d` entry,
> which is not from the Webflow table.

